68a9b/uploads/origins/77a2747d-5254-4990-a43c-6ba950f56cc3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f8a3aacdffda4741c32951d3ab1b3385 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi! I saw your art on my front page and I absolutely love it! I wanted to ask if I could get art of my VTuber OC Syn Vyarc!\n\nShe's a very bubbly, excited girl who looks for the best in everyone!\n\nI wanted to get one in your scribble-style art, but the pose and background are up to you!\nThank you!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1WZum8vhQBVyvPGu9w0q_fMrYrvEFQBV0?usp=share_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@yakinikusubacc/works/123", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/4bc105dd/uploads/origins/5c9fc296-bb4f-4535-9e41-6fab67fd9990?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d9641b7de182776fcce600d6ca319fba", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4bc105dd/uploads/origins/5c9fc296-bb4f-4535-9e41-6fab67fd9990?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d9641b7de182776fcce600d6ca319fba, https://si.imgix.net/4bc105dd/uploads/origins/5c9fc296-bb4f-4535-9e41-6fab67fd9990?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=585e82e7e5d290d33dd3fe680ac725d1 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4bc105dd/uploads/origins/5c9fc296-bb4f-4535-9e41-6fab67fd9990?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=107f8fec4aaa8336b171617c3bae0663 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "初めまして。よろしければ私のOCを描いていただきたいです...！\n\n参考資料\nhttps://lit.link/fyum\n\n 【詳細】  ※省略アレンジお任せします\n・猫耳＋緑髪(毛先青グラデ)＋横髪片方リボン編み込み三つ編み\n・困り眉\n・丸型(アンダーリム)涙眼鏡 ※なくても○\n・紫と赤の丸オッドアイ(タレ目＋ハートハイライト)\n・包帯(場所お任せ、なくても○)\n\n 性格：気が弱くおっちょこちょい、人見知り、恥ずかしがり屋\n\n【用途】\nSNSアイコンヘッダー等\nYouTube等の動画(サムネ、動画内)配信画面  \n\nご検討よろしくお願いいたします！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@yakinikusubacc/works/122", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/9829d170/uploads/origins/d1305123-9